_Beans\" title=\"Trapped Beans\">Trapped Beans</a> and doesn't have the \"X\" marking on the bottom.\n</p><p>The description says:&#160;:) little do they know... I'M NOT A BOMB!\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902011435\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 54/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 65/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019476/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.437      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   41.437      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2520-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902011435 and revision id 17000. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Classic Biome","exists":true},{"title":"Classic Store","exists":true},{"title":"Trapped Beans","exists":true}],"images":["Beans.png"]}
